# 04-delivery/exec-plans/

Execution plans for complex implementation work
(`.harness/gates.yml.before_complex_work`).

| Folder       | Purpose                                |
| ------------ | -------------------------------------- |
| `active/`    | Currently in-flight execution plans    |
| `completed/` | Archive of closed execution plans      |

Use `.harness/templates/execution-plan-template.md` and schema
`.harness/schemas/execution-plan.schema.yml`.
